ilippines, Iran, Italy, Greece, Turkey-region quakes, PNG, Fiji, Vanuatu, Solomon Is., New Zealand, etc.).\n\n3. **Cleaned the country set** — The source had **New Zealand duplicated** (2 features, OBJECTID 250 & 251); dropped one → clean **45 countries**.\n\n4. **Joined with GDP** — Merged countries to `GDP per capita (current US$)` on ISO3 code (`ISO_A3` ↔ `Country Code`). All 45 matched the **2020** value (45/45 non-null).\n\n### 2020 GDP per capita distribution (n = 45)\n\n| Statistic | Value (US$) |\n|---|---|\n| Mean | **11,865.51** |\n| Std Dev | 15,191.63 |\n| Min | 512.06 |\n| Max | 64,317.40 |\n\nThe high standard deviation reflects the mix of very high-income quake-prone nations (e.g., USA, Japan, Canada, Australia, New Zealand) alongside low-income ones (e.g., Afghanistan, Ethiopia, Uganda).\n\n**Answer: US$ 11,865.51 per capita on average.**", "tool_errors": [["get_unique_values", "Error: Column 'name' not found in DataFrame"], ["get_unique_values", "Error: Column 'name' not found in DataFrame"]], "unexposed_tool_calls": [], "repeat_failures": {"get_unique_values:{\"column\": \"name\", \"dataframe_name\": \"countries_with_eq\"}": 1, "get_unique_values:{\"column\": \"name\", \"dataframe_name\": \"countries\"}": 1}, "reference_step_counts": [7], "provenance": {"geobenchx_root": "/Users/rengong/Documents/agent/work/GeoBenchX", "geobenchx_head": "0edf6109ea5dca3e70fdfe081d39c9ccd0f832fb", "geobenchx_dirty": "e0f82aab84f7dcf1", "patches": {"geobenchx-0001-drop-colorbar-fmt.patch": true}, "matplotlib_backend": "Agg", "schema_hints": false}}
